# Structs live on interfaces

Declare every struct in `src/interfaces`. Do not declare a struct in a contract, abstract, or library.

The contract that stores or returns the type inherits the interface and uses the struct by name. Field order stays on the interface, because that order is the storage layout.

```solidity
// src/interfaces/IPactoUsernameNFT.sol
struct Membership {
  address evmAddress;
  uint64 tokenId;
  address pendingAddress;
}

// src/contracts/PactoUsernameNFT.sol
mapping(bytes32 npubHash => Membership membership) internal _memberships;
```
